{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1065545/block/singleImage/3277069/wm/01M871A28VTYT1YD5R60DT30QR.JPG?updatedAt=1795532733\"/><figcaption>宇晴軒兩房新近以2.05萬元租出。(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>中原地產西九龍碧海藍天分行高級區域經理許永生表示，中原最新促成荔枝角「西九四小龍」之一的宇晴軒 1 座低層 D 室租賃成交，單位實用面積約 451 方呎，採兩房間隔。單位坐向北方，享都市景，以 2.05 萬元租出，呎租約 45.5 元。 許永生指，業主於 2013 年以 465 萬元購入單位，近年一直作投資收租用途，現享約 5.3 厘租金回報，回報率豐厚。 資料顯示，宇晴軒位於四小龍深盛路 9 號， 2004 年入伙，共有 2 期涉及 6 座，提供 2,245 個單位。 即睇荔枝角宇晴軒租盤 (House730)</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T23:44:21.996043+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":283,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T22:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T00:10:45.783936+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T23:37:37.731438+00:00","content_hash":"fed22bbd873ddf13cef9f935c01de4e25088352e3d05cae4fde3024d2e117c74","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-24T23:44:21.996043+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}